{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 2360566,
  "courseSlug": "sveltejs-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Svelte.js - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14689754",
      "title": "More on Transitions",
      "lectureOrder": 132,
      "videoOrder": 116,
      "sourceHash": "c957b305aca75152ff279276f50705215b36385a67b1a34b5ac21e69784bf772",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 12.27,
          "en": "Another neat feature of the transition directive here is that the animations are reversible or cancellable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 12.3,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "Let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.21,
          "end": 14.48,
          "en": "For that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.48,
          "end": 16.88,
          "en": "Let's say we have another button here where I say toggle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.88,
          "end": 20.93,
          "en": "And below that I have a paragraph where I say, Can you see me?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.93,
          "end": 22.7,
          "en": "And I want to toggle that paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.7,
          "end": 28.22,
          "en": "So here I'll have a onClick listener where I essentially want to toggle a variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.9,
          "end": 32.56,
          "en": "Which I'll add up here, show paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.89,
          "end": 35.11,
          "en": "And initially that is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.79,
          "end": 39.51,
          "en": "And now down there on that, click here on the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.37,
          "end": 44.15,
          "en": "I want to set, set, show paragraph to what it's currently not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 44.15,
          "end": 47.75,
          "en": "So I want to toggle this variable, set it to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 47.75,
          "end": 49.49,
          "en": "If it's false and set it to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.49,
          "end": 55.82,
          "en": "If it's true, then here of course we can use a if check with show paragraph to decide whether or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 55.82,
          "end": 63.77,
          "en": "we want to show that paragraph now out of the box that simply adds or hides this paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.81,
          "end": 66.92,
          "en": "Now, to avoid this nasty chomp, let's add a horizontal line here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 66.92,
          "end": 67.52,
          "en": "Maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.52,
          "end": 72.77,
          "en": "But of course the core thing is that we have this paragraph appear and disappear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 73.22,
          "end": 78.74,
          "en": "Now let's add an animation to the paragraph so that this or transition so that this looks nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 78.74,
          "end": 80.72,
          "en": "And let's use the fly animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 80.72,
          "end": 84.71000000000001,
          "en": "And here I'll also let this fly in from the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 86.63,
          "end": 91.03999999999999,
          "en": "With that said, if I toggle this paragraph comes in and is removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 91.07,
          "end": 96.38,
          "en": "Now, if I cancel this in between, you see it actually is able to cancel this animation midway and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 96.38,
          "end": 100.91,
          "en": "reverse it before it is finished, which of course is really neat and can create a really good user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 100.91,
          "end": 101.63,
          "en": "experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 101.63,
          "end": 106.37,
          "en": "Since we don't have to wait for this animation to finish before it, then actually plays back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 106.4,
          "end": 108.71000000000001,
          "en": "Instead, it plays back in between.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 109.36,
          "end": 110.53,
          "en": "On the transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 110.53,
          "end": 117.49000000000001,
          "en": "You can also control, if you're animating in a list, whether this animation here should also play",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 117.49000000000001,
          "end": 121.48,
          "en": "when the whole list is added or only when items are added to the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 121.78,
          "end": 123.13,
          "en": "Let me show you an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 123.13,
          "end": 127.03,
          "en": "Let's say here we're using this show paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 127.93,
          "end": 132.25,
          "en": "Toggle also to show or hide this entire list down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 133.09,
          "end": 135.43,
          "en": "Now, let's first of all, add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 136.13,
          "end": 137.78,
          "en": "Apples and bananas.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 138.79,
          "end": 142.1,
          "en": "And of course you'll not see them because the list is not visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 142.12,
          "end": 145,
          "en": "But if I now hit toggle, the list flies in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 146.66,
          "end": 152.15,
          "en": "Now, that might be the effect you want, but maybe in this case you want to have the list there out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 152.15,
          "end": 152.6,
          "en": "of the box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 152.6,
          "end": 157.52,
          "en": "It should just appear as a whole and only the addition of single items should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 157.57999999999998,
          "end": 163.1,
          "en": "To achieve this, you can go to your transition here and after the name of the transition, you add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 163.1,
          "end": 170.18,
          "en": "this pipe symbol, which you know as a modifier from bindings, and here you can add local.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 170.26,
          "end": 172.31,
          "en": "Local defines that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 172.31,
          "end": 177.68,
          "en": "Now this transition should only play for the addition of a single item, and not if multiple of these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 177.68,
          "end": 179.76,
          "en": "items are added simultaneously.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 179.78,
          "end": 182.75,
          "en": "So now if I add apples here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 184.14,
          "end": 185.34,
          "en": "And bananas.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 185.37,
          "end": 188.7,
          "en": "And then toggle the whole list appears just like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 188.7,
          "end": 191.88,
          "en": "And only single items if I add them to the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 191.91,
          "end": 194.88,
          "en": "These are still animated the removal too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 194.88,
          "end": 197.34,
          "en": "But if I toggle, the whole list just disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 197.34,
          "end": 202.71,
          "en": "So this is a nice adjustment that allows you to control how the whole list and the single items should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 202.71,
          "end": 207.66,
          "en": "behave and that you only have an animation for the single items and not for the entire list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 211.2,
          "en": "Now, last but not least, about transitions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 211.2,
          "end": 216.84,
          "en": "There are also events that are fired by svelte at certain points of the transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 217.82999999999998,
          "end": 222.86,
          "en": "Let's say you're interested in when the transition starts and when it ends.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 228.18,
          "en": "And that might be the case both for when the item is added and when it is removed for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 228.18,
          "end": 231.51,
          "en": "As I just said, there are certain events you can listen to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 232.25,
          "end": 240.14,
          "en": "You do this with on and then the event names are intro start which fires when the element is added and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 240.14,
          "end": 244.22,
          "en": "the transition to edit or to animate it in starts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 244.58,
          "end": 250.64,
          "en": "And here we can simply console log adding the element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 252.61,
          "end": 253.57,
          "en": "Starts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 258.17,
          "end": 265.54,
          "en": "Then we also have on Intro end, which is played when the addition of the element comes to an end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 265.55,
          "end": 269.24,
          "en": "So when the fade in or whatever you have, animation ends.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 270.74,
          "end": 278.42,
          "en": "So adding the element ends and then we have the same for removing the element from the Dom with outro",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 278.42,
          "end": 279.47,
          "en": "start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 280.55,
          "end": 282.71,
          "en": "And outro end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 282.74,
          "end": 289.79,
          "en": "So here removing the element ends here removing the element starts if we save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 290.89,
          "end": 296.83,
          "en": "And I add apples here and I toggle my list and I then add bananas.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 299.12,
          "end": 301.1,
          "en": "You see, we got adding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 301.1,
          "end": 304.49,
          "en": "The element starts adding, The element ends once it's at its final position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 304.49,
          "end": 307.16,
          "en": "And when I click the item we got removing starts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 307.16,
          "end": 307.97,
          "en": "Removing ends.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 307.97,
          "end": 313.34,
          "en": "So this can also be nice if you have some other code that should run when the animation starts or when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 313.34,
          "end": 313.94,
          "en": "it's done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 313.94,
          "end": 314.93,
          "en": "Animating in.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
